WEBVTT

00:00:59.145 --> 00:01:00.515
(Fin du beatbox)

00:01:00.555 --> 00:01:02.408
(Rires)

00:01:02.432 --> 00:01:07.471
(Beatbox)

00:01:15.912 --> 00:01:17.825
Papa, papa,

00:01:17.849 --> 00:01:19.842
Temps mort, temps mort !

00:01:19.866 --> 00:01:22.127
Mon Dieu.

00:01:22.151 --> 00:01:23.692
OK, il essaye
de me provoquer.

00:01:23.716 --> 00:01:25.858
Pause !

00:01:25.882 --> 00:01:29.721
Tu te souviens m'avoir
bercée au beatbox ?

00:01:29.895 --> 00:01:31.324
Oui, oui, je m'en souviens.